                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The terminite's last action was a successful jaws Strike against a creature</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The terminite's reality-shearing mandibles pry free a piece of the target. The target takes @Damage[2d8[slashing]] damage with a @Check[fortitude|dc:24] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes no damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Drained]{Drained 1}. If the terminite doesn't have a mote (see below), it gains a mote of the target's essence that vanishes after 24 hours. While the terminite has this mote, it knows the distance and direction to the target.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but double damage and the target's drained value increases by 1 if it was already drained.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
