                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The terminite has a target's mote from Essence Rip</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The terminite consumes the mote. The target reduces its drained value by 1 and the terminite regains @Damage[2d10[healing]] Hit Points.</p>"
